INTERIM LICENSE NOTE
====================

This module is in transition. Per ADR 0011 (Client Core Re-licensing Path,
docs/adr/0011-client-core-relicensing-path.md), code written by this
project's contributors will be re-licensed to Apache 2.0 once the
NetBird-derived sources are fully replaced via clean-room rewrite.

Until that exit criterion is met, the entire `clients/core` module
remains AGPL-3.0-or-later. Embedders must comply with AGPL terms
(including network-use disclosure obligations).
